<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>You're in — Spark Conference</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#FBF7EE;
    --ink:#15161A;
    --blue:#2D4CFF;
    --coral:#FF5A36;
    --yellow:#FFCE33;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    min-height:100svh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:24px;
  }
  h1{font-family:'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-weight:400;}
  .mono{font-family:'Space Mono', monospace; letter-spacing:0.04em; text-transform:uppercase;}
  .card{
    max-width:480px;
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .stamp{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    background:var(--yellow);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:8px 16px;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    margin-bottom:26px;
    transform:rotate(-2deg);
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .stamp::before{content:'⚡';}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem); margin-bottom:16px;}
  p{font-size:1.02rem; margin-bottom:36px; color:#D9D6CC; font-weight:500;}
  .btn{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    width:100%;
    padding:16px 26px;
    font-family:'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    text-decoration:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:3px solid var(--paper);
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--paper);
    margin-bottom:14px;
    transition:transform 0.15s ease;
    box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--paper);
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px); box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--paper);}
  .btn-primary{
    background:#25D366;
    color:#06210F;
    border-color:#25D366;
    box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--paper);
  }
  footer{margin-top:28px; color:#9A96A6; font-size:0.85rem;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="stamp mono">Spark Conference · 30 Oct 2026</div>
    <h1>You're in.<br>Welcome to the crew.</h1>
    <p>Join the volunteer WhatsApp group below for unit details, schedules, and updates before the day.</p>
 
    <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/L1LGnJVaREg1cjDqiTztdp?s=cl&p=a&mlu=0" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Join the WhatsApp group</a>
    <a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=Spark%20Conference&dates=20261030/20261031&details=Spark%20Conference%20%E2%80%94%20student%20conference." target="_blank" class="btn">Add to Google Calendar</a>
    <a href="data:text/calendar;charset=utf-8,BEGIN%3AVCALENDAR%0D%0AVERSION%3A2.0%0D%0APRODID%3A-//Spark%20Conference//Volunteer%20Signup//EN%0D%0ABEGIN%3AVEVENT%0D%0AUID%3Aspark-conference-2026%40sparkconference%0D%0ADTSTAMP%3A20260730T000000Z%0D%0ADTSTART%3BVALUE%3DDATE%3A20261030%0D%0ADTEND%3BVALUE%3DDATE%3A20261031%0D%0ASUMMARY%3ASpark%20Conference%0D%0ADESCRIPTION%3ASpark%20Conference%20%E2%80%94%20student%20conference.%0D%0AEND%3AVEVENT%0D%0AEND%3AVCALENDAR%0D%0A" download="spark-conference.ics" class="btn">Download .ics</a>
 
    <footer>Questions? educationinview111@gmail.com</footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>